# The site documents two lines whose pages are copies of one another, so a
# CRLF/LF split between /preview and the root shows up as a whole-file diff even
# when the prose is identical — and it hides the differences that matter.
# Normalizing on the way in makes the two trees comparable byte for byte,
# regardless of each contributor's core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf
